ck's tarp. He asks to see the Labor's permit, but the truck runs the road block. The police give chase, but the Labor in the back of the truck fires upon them destroying all the police cars following. It is a Self Defense Forces Labor. Later that night, Gotoh calls Shinobu outside her house. He tells her that a truck with a military Labor ran a road block and shot up several police cars. With the Japanese military in the middle of war games, it will take several days for them to account for all their Labors. Are the military trying to stage a coup?","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The Second Unit are on vacation. Most of the team have a place to go except Gotoh, who just seems to want to hang around the office with Shinobu, and Asuma who decides to go to his father's factory. Meanwhile in Tokyo, a police road block stops a truck. One of the policemen become suspicious when they see a Labor under the truck's tarp. He asks to see the Labor's permit, but the truck runs the road block. The police give chase, but the Labor in the back of the truck fires upon them destroying all the police cars following. It is a Self Defense Forces Labor. Later that night, Gotoh calls Shinobu outside her house. He tells her that a truck with a military Labor ran a road block and shot up several police cars. With the Japanese military in the middle of war games, it will take several days for them to account for all their Labors. Are the military trying to stage a coup?"}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1096","mal:1096"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12298","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"1518","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"395","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"537","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"770","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"770","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"7